    <string name="ph_howto_title">How to insert your own faces and voices</string>
    <string name="ph_howto_1">1. Put friend_ivan.png into android/app/src/main/assets/characters/ — transparent PNG, 800×800 or larger.</string>
    <string name="ph_howto_2">2. Put friend_ivan_win.m4a into android/app/src/main/assets/sounds/ (AAC, up to 3 s).</string>
    <string name="ph_howto_3">3. New person — add an object to characters.json (id, name, kind, tags, photo, initials).</string>
    <string name="ph_howto_4">4. Rebuild the APK — real faces are inside, no code changes.</string>

