    <string name="about_title">About</string>
    <string name="about_privacy">Photos never leave the phone. Local mode works offline.</string>
    <string name="about_consent">Use photos of people who agree to it. This is a private game for your own crew, not a public service.</string>
    <string name="about_legal">Images of individuals are protected by law. That is why the game is not published on Google Play or RuStore, but shared as an APK.</string>
    <string name="about_offline">No analytics, no ads, no accounts.</string>
    <string name="about_howto">How to shoot faces: front camera, plain background, light from the front. Emotion beats quality. Do not compress photos in a messenger.</string>

