    <string name="rules_title">How to play</string>
    <string name="rules_step_1">1. You get a character. You cannot see it — the others hold the phone.</string>
    <string name="rules_step_2">2. When everyone has seen their character, take turns asking questions about yours.</string>
    <string name="rules_step_3">3. Ask yes/no questions. A “yes” lets you ask again. A “no” passes the turn to the next player.</string>
    <string name="rules_step_4">4. Guess who you are and you win. Everything else happens in real life: the phone only shows cards.</string>
